It's time to search for the nine\nstones the hero sealed off! \e
Those things are "Mana Stones." \kIf you gather enough of them, \nyour LIFE will increase!  \e
Press the arrow key twice to\nperform a Dash move.\kYou should try it right away! \e
Those things are "Mana Stones." \kBut it seems they're already  \ngone... \e
Once you've achieved "Rank S" \nyou can come here.\kAfter clearing the game, select \n"NEW GAME" on the title screen\nand head over here. \e
